=== FILE index.html ===
<h1>
	Block vs. inline elements
</h1>

<p>
	Some elements break onto a new line. Some elements don’t!
</p>

<p>
	This is a paragraph, and it gets a new line.
</p>

<p>
	But, what if you want <strong>bold</strong> text?
</p>

<p>
	Or, <em>italic text?</em>
</p>

<p>
	Elements inside of other elements are called <strong>children.</strong> The outer elements are called <strong>parents.</strong>
</p>

